WEBVTT

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.080
(GASPING)

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.000
No, Andy! No. No, Andy! No!

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:19.040
(CHOKING)
Andy. Andy. (GARBLED)

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.080
(VOICE ECHOING) Bye, Woody.

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:25.200
No! No! Andy!

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.200
(SCREAMING, GASPING)

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:33.600
(GRUNTS, COUGHS)

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.880
(COUGHING)

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:41.320
-(CONTINUES COUGHING)
-WOODY: Wheezy, is that you?

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.720
-Hey, Woody.
-What are you doing up here?

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:47.000
I thought Mom took you
to get your squeaker fixed months ago.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.360
-Andy was so upset.
-Nah.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.520
She just told him that
to calm him down

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.600
and then put me on the shelf.

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:57.000
-Why didn't you yell for help?
-Well, I tried squeakin'.

00:00:57.080 --> 00:01:01.160
But I'm still broken.
No one could hear me. (WHEEZES)

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:06.560
(COUGHS) Besides, the dust
aggravates my condition.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:09.160
(WHEEZES, COUGHS)

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:13.720
What's the point
in prolonging the inevitable?

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:17.840
We're all just one stitch away
from here to there.

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:22.080
Yard sale? Yard sale!

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:26.240
Yard sale! Guys, wake up, wake up!
There's a yard sale outside!

00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:28.360
-Yard sale?
-Sarge, emergency roll call!

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:30.440
Sir, yes, sir! Red alert!

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:34.720
All civilians fall in position now!
Single file! Let's move, move, move!

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:35.840
-Hamm?
-Here.

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:37.360
-Potato Head, Mr. and Mrs.?
-BOTH: Here.

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:39.240
Troikas. Check,
check, check, check, check.

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:41.160
I hate yard sales!

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:42.720
(YELPS) Someone's coming!

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.200
(GASPS)

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:49.760
Okay. Let's see what's up here.

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:01.320
(PUZZLE PIECES RATTLING)

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:08.280
Bye, Woody.

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:18.120
Wheezy! Think, think, Woody.
Think, think, think.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:21.440
Ooh... (BLOWS RASPBERRY,
SPUTTERS, WHISTLES)

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:23.600
-(BARKING)
-Hey. Here, boy. Here, Buster!

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:27.560
Up here! No, no, no, no, no, no!

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.560
Okay, boy. To the yard sale! Hyah!

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:32.480
POTATO HEAD:
What's goin' on? He's nuts.

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:33.640
His arm ain't that bad.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:36.000
Don't do it, Woody! We love you!

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.760
-WOODY: Careful on the steps, now.
-(GRUNTING)

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:44.240
(BUSTER PANTS)

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:48.000
(CHILD LAUGHING)

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.360
Okay, boy. Let's go.
And keep it casual.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:05.760
WOODY: Not that casual.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.240
(CHILD BABBLING)

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:11.520
HAMM: Piggy bank coming through,
coming through.

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:14.040
REX: Is he out there?
BUZZ: There he is.

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:22.080
-(WOODY GRUNTS)
-(MAN WHISTLING)

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:26.000
REX: He's getting in the box!

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:28.320
HAMM: He's sellin' himself
for 25 cents!

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:30.000
Woody, you're worth more than that.

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:32.480
BUZZ: Hold on. Hold on.
He's got something.

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:34.200
-It's Wheezy!
-ALL: Wheezy?

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:37.320
Hey, it's not suicide. It's a rescue.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:39.120
-(WOODY GRUNTS)
-(WHEEZY SQUEAKING)

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:44.200
Good boy, Buster. Hold still.
There. There you go, pal.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:46.880
-Bless you, Woody.
-All right, now.

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.560
Back to Andy's room. Hyah!

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:51.200
-(TOYS LAUGHING)
-BUZZ: Way to go, cowboy.

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:55.040
-SLINKY: Golly bob howdy!
-Woody, I'm slipping!

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:58.120
(YELLS, GRUNTS)

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:04.320
(CHILD LAUGHING)
Mommy... Mommy, look! Look at this!

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:07.960
-Mommy, look! It's a cowboy dolly!
-Hey, that's not her toy!

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:09.880
SLINKY: What's that little gal
think she's doin'?

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.760
Mommy, Mommy, can we get it?
Please? Mommy, please?

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:15.240
Oh, honey. You don't want
that toy. It's broken.

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:17.640
VOICE BOX:
There's a snake in my boot.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.080
(MAN GASPING)

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:25.960
Original hand-painted face.
Natural-dyed, blanket-stitched vest!

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:30.960
Little rip. Fixable. Oh, if only you had
your hand-stitched, polyvinyl...

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.680
(GASPS, LAUGHS HYSTERICALLY)
A hat! I found him!

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:35.360
I found him! I found him!

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:39.080
-(CONTINUES LAUGHING)
-ANDY'S MOTHER: Buster! Quiet down!

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:41.000
-Excuse me. Can I help you?
-Yes.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:43.320
You can help take his paws off my pal.

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:45.960
I'll give you 50 cents
for all this junk.

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:48.640
-Oh, now, how did this get down here?
-BUZZ: Hand her the sheriff.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:50.320
Nice and easy.

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:53.120
-$5.
-I'm sorry. It's an old family toy.

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:55.760
-(GROANS)
-Now just walk away.

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:57.280
-Wait.
-The other way.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:00.160
-I'll give you 50 bucks for it.
-50 bucks ain't bad.

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:02.800
-MOTHER: It's not for sale.
-Everything's for sale.

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:05.520
-Or trade. You like my watch?
-Sorry.

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:09.520
-He's safe. Way to go Andy's mom!
-She showed him!

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:11.680
-Molly, don't touch that, sweetie.
-(SPUTTERING, GROANING)

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:14.320
POTATO HEAD:
Yeah. Go home, Mr. Fancy Car.

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:17.000
BUZZ: Hold on.
HAMM: What's up?

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.800
REX: What is it, Buzz?

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:21.880
-(CRASH)
-TOYS: What's happening?

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:22.960
What's he doing?

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:25.840
I can't watch!
Can someone cover my eyes?

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:28.560
BUZZ: He's stealin' Woody!
REX: What? He can't take Woody.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:29.680
It's illegal.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:31.520
-Where's he going?
-Do something.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:32.840
BO PEEP: Buzz!

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:35.720
-(GASPING)
-POTATO HEAD: Get him, Buzz.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.560
Where's the red jacket?

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:45.080
(GASPING, GRUNTING)

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:46.800
(ENGINE REVVING)

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:52.360
(GRUNTING)

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.720
(CRIES OUT, GRUNTS)

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:16.680
Why would someone steal Woody?

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:27.280
(GASPING, GRUNTING)

